msgstr "Dr. Caroll: \n"

#. "L_LUE_050"
msgid "Explosives\n"
msgstr "Explosifs\n"

#. "L_LUE_051"
msgid "Explosives\n"
msgstr "Explosifs\n"

#. "L_LUE_052"
msgid "Picked up explosives.\n"
msgstr "Explosifs obtenus.\n"

#. "L_LUE_053"
msgid ""
"The air intercept radar is controlled from that \n"
"bunker.\n"
msgstr ""
"Le radar d'interception est contrôlé depuis \n"
"ce bunker.\n"

#. "L_LUE_054"
msgid ""
"There's the antenna, but... I can't throw a bug \n"
"that high!\n"
msgstr ""
"Voilà l'antenne, mais... Je ne peux pas lancer \n"
"un mouchard si haut!\n"

#. "L_LUE_055"
msgid ""
"The hangar lift is on the other side \n"
"of that huge door.\n"
msgstr ""
"L'ascenseur du hangar est derrière \n"
"cette grande porte.\n"

#. "L_LUE_056"
msgid ""
"Careful with that trigger finger, Agent Dark - \n"
"you're closing in on my position.\n"
msgstr ""
"Attention à ne pas descendre n'importe qui, Agent Dark - \n"
"vous vous approchez de ma position.\n"

#. "L_LUE_057"
msgid "Lift access terminals destroyed.\n"
msgstr "Terminaux d'accès ascenseur détruits.\n"

#. "L_LUE_058"
msgid ""
"Okay, Joanna, take a look at this. Our \n"
"operative inside Area 51 was able to get \n"
"this out to us.\n"
msgstr ""
"Regardez Joanna: notre agent infiltré \n"
"dans le Secteur 51 a pu nous faire \n"
"parvenir ceci.\n"

#. "L_LUE_059"
msgid ""
"This is your entry point... A deserted helipad \n"
"on the edge of the base.\n"
msgstr ""
"C'est votre point d'entrée: un héliport \n"
"abandonné en bordure de la base.\n"

#. "L_LUE_060"
msgid ""
"The lift down to the hangars and the \n"
"rendezvous point is beyond that wall... \n"
"Watch out for these guards.\n"
msgstr ""
"L'ascenseur vers les hangars et le \n"
"point de rendez-vous est derrière ce \n"
"mur. Attention aux gardes.\n"

#. "L_LUE_061"
msgid ""
"Here is the communications antenna. \n"
"Attach a comms rider bug so we can talk to \n"
"you when you're inside the base. Again, \n"
"watch out for hostiles.\n"
msgstr ""
"Voici l'antenne de communication. Fixez \n"
"un Déroute-Comms et nous pourrons vous \n"
"parler dans la base. Encore une fois, \n"
"faites attention à la sécurité.\n"

#. "L_LUE_062"
msgid "Oh, my God!\n"
msgstr "Oh, mon Dieu!\n"

#. "L_LUE_063"
msgid ""
"Here is our friend. He appears to be \n"
"physically unhurt, though he hasn't \n"
"regained consciousness yet. By the look \n"
"of it, the surgeons are almost done with \n"
"their preliminary tests and will begin \n"
"dissection soon.\n"
msgstr ""
"Voici notre ami. Il ne semble pas blessé \n"
"bien qu'il n'ait pas encore repris ses \n"
"esprits. De toute évidence, les chirurgiens \n"
"ont presque achevé leurs préparations \n"
"et vont bientôt entamer la dissection.\n"

#. "L_LUE_064"
msgid "But who was...?\n"
msgstr "Mais qui est...?\n"

#. "L_LUE_065"
msgid ""
"Any questions? No. Good. Away you go to \n"
"the hangar.\n"
msgstr ""
"Des questions? Non? Bon. En route \n"
"vers le hangar.\n"

#. "L_LUE_066"
msgid ""
"Agent Dark Mission Log, 1028 hours. Against \n"
"my better judgement, I'm about to enter \n"
"Area 51.\n"
msgstr ""
"Agent Dark, Journal de mission, H: 10:28. \n"
"Je suis sur le point d'accéder au \n"
"Secteur 51.\n"

#. "L_LUE_067"
msgid "Agent Dark! Over here!\n"
msgstr "Agent Dark! Par ici!\n"

#. "L_LUE_068"
msgid ""
"There you are! I was beginning to wonder \n"
"if...\n"
msgstr ""
"Vous voilà, vous! Je pensais \n"
"que...\n"

#. "L_LUE_069"
msgid "If what?\n"
msgstr "Que quoi?\n"

#. "L_LUE_070"
msgid ""
"If you'd been discovered yet. And frankly, \n"
"if this is how you work, I'm amazed that \n"
"you lasted longer than five minutes.\n"
msgstr ""
"Que vous étiez mort. Vous devez \n"
"avoir une bonne étoile pour être \n"
"encore en vie.\n"

#. "L_LUE_071"
msgid "I was tidying up one of your loose ends.\n"
msgstr "Je m'occupais de votre boulot mal fait.\n"

#. "L_LUE_072"
msgid "My loose ends?\n"
msgstr "Mal quoi?\n"

#. "L_LUE_073"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry, I didn't realize you wanted him \n"
"to shoot you. I can call in some more guards \n"
"if you like.\n"
msgstr ""
"Vous vouliez peut-être que ce garde vous \n"
"descende? Très bien. Je peux en appeler un \n"
"autre si vous voulez...\n"

#. "L_LUE_074"
msgid ""
"Okay, okay, forget about it. I'm going to let \n"
"the Institute know we've made contact.\n"
msgstr ""
"Bon, bon. Laissez tomber. Je préviens \n"
"l'Institut de notre rencontre.\n"

#. "L_LUE_075"
msgid "Foreign object detected - security alerted.\n"
msgstr "Objet étranger détecté - sécurité alertée.\n"
